     "text": "Derivative = gradient of the tangent = instantaneous rate of change. Rules: power, sum, constant multiple, product, quotient, chain. Uses: tangents and normals, increasing/decreasing, maxima and minima, rates and optimisation. Integration reverses differentiation: ∫ from a to b of f dx = F(b) − F(a), the net area."
